{"seq":4,"slug":"sutva-and-interference","title":"SUTVA 与干扰：当处理会「溢出」","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/causal-inference/effect-decomposition/sutva-and-interference","wordCount":2008,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"sutva-与干扰-当处理会-溢出\">SUTVA 与干扰：当处理会「溢出」</h1><p>潜在结果框架的全部优雅都建立在一条安静的前提上——SUTVA。Donald Rubin 1980 年在《Journal of the American Statistical Association》的评论文章中将其命名为 Stable Unit Treatment Value Assumption（稳定单元处理值假设），它其实包含两半：<strong>无干扰</strong>（我的结果只取决于我自己是否被处理）与<strong>一致性</strong>（&quot;被处理&quot;是唯一明确的状态）。一旦单元之间互相影响——疫苗保护、社交网络、双边市场——这两半都会碎裂，此时天真估计出的不只是噪声，而是系统性偏差：连随机化本身都救不回来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SUTVA 的两半与破坏后果，下表先概览。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>组成</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n<th>被破坏时</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>无干扰</td>\n<td>单元 i 的结果只依赖 i 自己的处理分配</td>\n<td>溢出效应混入估计，偏差方向不定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一致性</td>\n<td>处理没有隐藏的不同版本</td>\n<td>&quot;处理效应&quot;一词失去定义</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两半都是关于世界的建模承诺而非统计性质。下文先讲清它们各自何时碎裂，再谈补救设计与估计思路。</p>\n<h2 id=\"sutva-的两半\">SUTVA 的两半</h2><p>形式化地说，完整潜在结果是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_i(\\mathbf{Z})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>——它依赖全体单元的分配向量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{Z}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Z</span></span></span></span></span>；SUTVA 断言这个多元函数退化为一元函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_i(Z_i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，即别人的分配与我无关。一致性则要求 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_i=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 对应同一个物理动作：10mg 与 50mg 剂量不是同一处理；&quot;20% 流量灰度的新算法&quot;与&quot;全量新算法&quot;也不是同一处理——把灰度实验的效应外推到全量上线，违反的正是这一半。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Z[&quot;分配向量 Z = (Z_1, ..., Z_n)&quot;] --&gt; Y1[&quot;自己的分配 Z_i&quot;]&#10;    Z --&gt; Y2[&quot;邻居的分配 Z_-i&quot;]&#10;    Y1 --&gt; O[&quot;单元 i 的结果 Y_i&quot;]&#10;    Y2 -.-&gt;|&quot;干扰路径: SUTVA 禁止&quot;| O\">flowchart TD\n    Z[\"分配向量 Z = (Z_1, ..., Z_n)\"] --&gt; Y1[\"自己的分配 Z_i\"]\n    Z --&gt; Y2[\"邻居的分配 Z_-i\"]\n    Y1 --&gt; O[\"单元 i 的结果 Y_i\"]\n    Y2 -.-&gt;|\"干扰路径: SUTVA 禁止\"| O</pre><p>为什么值得单独一章？因为数字平台的默认现实就是干扰：用户互相影响、市场双边联动、库存全局共享。识别策略再精巧，前提塌了结论就是错的——这是所有因果方法里最容易被工程师忽略的一层。</p>\n<h2 id=\"干扰何时出现\">干扰何时出现</h2><p>三类高频场景各有形状：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>疫苗与公共卫生</strong>：邻居接种降低了我的感染概率（群体免疫）。Halloran 与 Struchiner 1995 年在《Epidemiology》上系统提出传染病的因果推断框架，指出天真比较既会低估疫苗的直接效力，也会把&quot;接触少&quot;误算成&quot;疫苗好&quot;。</li>\n<li><strong>社交平台</strong>：A/B 分流后，实验组用户的活跃改变了对照组用户刷到的信息环境——两组共享同一张社交图，分流线形同虚设。Gui 等 2015 年在 WWW 会议提出的网络 A/B 测试方法正是为此而生。</li>\n<li><strong>双边市场</strong>：给司机一侧发补贴立刻影响乘客一侧的等待时间；价格实验中两个分组共享同一池水。Michael Sobel 2006 年发表于《JASA》的住房流动项目分析说明：干扰之下，随机化的&quot;黄金标准&quot;光环并不能自动给出可解释的答案。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Rosenbaum 2007 年在《JASA》上进一步讨论了一般化的干扰结构：只要存在任何一条绕过自身分配的通路，SUTVA 即告失效。工程上的教训是：<strong>先问&quot;我的实验单元之间有没有信息、资源或行为的管道&quot;，再谈估计</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"缓解设计-exposure-mapping-与-cluster-randomization\">缓解设计：exposure mapping 与 cluster randomization</h2><p>无法消除干扰时，可以重新设计实验让它在分析层面可控：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>cluster randomization（整群随机化）</strong>：以村、校区、城市为单位整体分臂，让主要交互发生在簇内、簇间近似隔离。Richard Hayes 与 Alexander Moulton 的专著《Cluster Randomised Trials》（CRC Press）系统论述了这一设计族。代价直白：有效样本量从&quot;人数&quot;缩水为&quot;群数&quot;，功效大幅下降。</li>\n<li><strong>exposure mapping（暴露映射）</strong>：Benjamin Aronow 与 Cyrus Samii 2017 年发表于《Annals of Applied Statistics》的核心想法是——别再问&quot;你被分到哪个臂&quot;，改问&quot;你处于哪种暴露状态&quot;。定义 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z_i=g_i(\\mathbf{Z})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathbf\">Z</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>（例如&quot;自己用药且邻居用药比例超过三成&quot;），在暴露条件层面重新定义因果量，再用逆概率加权估计。威力在于能同时报告直接效应与各档溢出；软肋在于它要求你知道网络结构与映射函数本身——这经常比估计更难。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>设计</th>\n<th>化解什么</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>整群随机化</td>\n<td>簇内干扰归拢</td>\n<td>功效骤降、群间异质性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>暴露映射</td>\n<td>显式建模多档暴露</td>\n<td>需要网络数据与映射假设</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>地理切分</td>\n<td>市场整体联动</td>\n<td>地区间差异需要校正</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>switchback</td>\n<td>单一市场不可分割</td>\n<td>引入 carryover 问题</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"spillover-估计思路\">spillover 估计思路</h2><p>一旦承认干扰，要估计的对象就得重新说清楚。Michael Hudgens 与 Elizabeth Halloran 2008 年发表于《JASA》的论文给出了标准分解：固定邻居分配 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbf{z}_{-i}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6528em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 不变，<strong>直接效应</strong>是自身分配翻转带来的差</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">[</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">z</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathrm{DE}(\\mathbf{z}_{-i})=\\mathbb{E}\\big[Y_i(1,\\mathbf{z}_{-i})\\big]-\\mathbb{E}\\big[Y_i(0,\\mathbf{z}_{-i})\\big]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">DE</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">[</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">]</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>而 <strong>spillover（间接）效应</strong>是保持自身不动、改变邻居分配带来的差，如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">1</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>−</mo><mi mathvariant=\"double-struck\">E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mn mathvariant=\"bold\">0</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathbb{E}[Y_i(0,\\mathbf{1}_{-i})]-\\mathbb{E}[Y_i(0,\\mathbf{0}_{-i})]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">1</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathbb\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathbf\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)]</span></span></span></span></span>。他们配套的两阶段随机化设计（先在群体层随机选簇、再在个体层随机分配）让这些量真正可估。推断层面，Susan Athey、Dean Eckles 与 Guido Imbens 在《JASA》（2018 年前后刊出）给出了网络干扰下基于随机化的精确 p 值方法，绕开了对分布形式的依赖。两条工程红线：报告直接效应必须声明&quot;在何种邻居暴露水平下&quot;；只测总效应而不拆结构，会把&quot;产品好&quot;与&quot;邻居变好&quot;永久混淆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"平台实验-switchback-与时间片轮转\">平台实验：switchback 与时间片轮转</h2><p>双边市场的终极难题是没有第二个市场可用——这时只剩时间维度可切。switchback 实验（时间片轮转）：同一市场在连续时段交替切换处理臂（周一 A 臂、周二 B 臂……），用同一市场自身的波动做对照。它买来了组间可比性，卖出了新麻烦：<strong>carryover effects</strong>——上一时段的处理残留（库存没清完、用户习惯已改变）污染下一时段。Iavor Bojinov、David Simchi-Levi 与 Jinglong 的《Design and Analysis of Switchback Experiments》（arXiv:2009.00148）在马尔可夫框架下系统处理了这类实验的设计与方差估计。实践法则有三条：切换周期应长于系统的记忆长度（库存周转天数、用户行为惯性的量级）；切换边界附近的数据单独监控甚至剔除；switchback 估计的是&quot;时间平均&quot;的效应，对跨期累积效果要另行建模。</p>\n<p>选择指引收束成一句话：单元独立就个体随机化；社区强交互就整群随机化；有网络数据就画 exposure map；单一不可分割市场就在地理切分与 switchback 之间按 carryover 风险权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>SUTVA 两半：无干扰（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 只依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Z</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Z_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）与一致性（处理版本唯一），破坏任一都会让随机化失去解释力（Rubin, 1980, JASA）。</li>\n<li>高危场景：疫苗的群体免疫（Halloran &amp; Struchiner, 1995）、社交网络的共享图、双边市场的两侧联动（Sobel, 2006）。</li>\n<li>缓解靠设计：整群随机化换隔离但损功效；exposure mapping 在暴露状态层面重定义因果量（Aronow &amp; Samii, 2017）。</li>\n<li>spillover 估计先拆直接/间接效应（Hudgens &amp; Halloran, 2008），推断走随机化精确 p 值（Athey, Eckles &amp; Imbens）。</li>\n<li>单一市场退路是 switchback 时间片轮转，命门是切换周期须长于系统记忆（Bojinov 等，arXiv:2009.00148）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"相关篇目\">相关篇目</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../potential-outcomes/randomization\">随机化为何有效与框架应用</a>：SUTVA 正是随机化推理安静的前提，本篇讲它碎裂时怎么办。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../methods/method-selection\">方法的选择与局限</a>：SUTVA 与&quot;无未观测混淆&quot;同属不可检验假设，破坏后标准选型即失效，补救只能靠设计。</li>\n<li><a href=\"synthetic-control\">合成控制法：面板数据上的虚拟对照组</a>：同样以无干扰（与无预期）为隐含前提的面板方法。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"SUTVA 与干扰：当处理会「溢出」","id":"sutva-与干扰-当处理会-溢出"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"SUTVA 的两半","id":"sutva-的两半"},{"level":2,"text":"干扰何时出现","id":"干扰何时出现"},{"level":2,"text":"缓解设计：exposure mapping 与 cluster randomization","id":"缓解设计-exposure-mapping-与-cluster-randomization"},{"level":2,"text":"spillover 估计思路","id":"spillover-估计思路"},{"level":2,"text":"平台实验：switchback 与时间片轮转","id":"平台实验-switchback-与时间片轮转"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关篇目","id":"相关篇目"}],"prev":{"title":"合成控制法：面板数据上的虚拟对照组","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/causal-inference/effect-decomposition/synthetic-control"},"next":{"title":"双重机器学习与工业工具链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/causal-inference/causal-ml-frontier/dml-and-toolchain"}}